        <mxCell id="pybLTMQL8zqX4GUhbAeI-16" parent="pybLTMQL8zqX4GUhbAeI-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante “Logout” presente &amp;nbsp;nell’Area Personale.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema richiede conferma della disconnessione tramite un messaggio a video: “Sei sicuro di &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    v&lt;/span&gt;oler uscire?”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante “Conferma”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema interrompe la sessione attiva e cancella i dati dell’utente memorizzati &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;temporaneamente.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema mostra a schermo la schermata princ&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;ipale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="202" width="495" x="435" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="202" width="495" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
