        <mxCell id="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-14" parent="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-1" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="390" width="960" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-15" parent="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flusso degli eventi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="390" width="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="390" width="380" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-16" parent="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante “Login”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata di login contenente il pulsante “Entra con SPID/eIDAS”&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante “Entra con SPID/eIDAS”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video un menu a tendina contenente l&#39;elenco dei Provider disponibili.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente seleziona il proprio Provider cliccando sull&#39;apposito voce del menù.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;6.Il sistema mostra a schermo il form di autenticazione del provider scelto&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente inserisce le proprie credenziali nel form e clicca sul pulsante “Conferma”&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema richiede al provider l&#39;esito dell&#39;autenticazione&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;. Il Provider invia l’esito, e il codice fiscale dell’autenticazione al Sistema.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;b&gt;SE&lt;/b&gt; l’esito è negativo:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;9.1&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di errore: “Accesso Negato:&amp;nbsp; Clicca qui Per Registarti”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9; &lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;.2&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante Registrati per chiudere il messaggio di errore.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;9.3&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema invoca il caso d&#39; uso &quot;Registrazione Studente&quot;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;. ALTRIMENTI (Esito positivo):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;10.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema interroga DBMS per verificare se lo studente è registrato alla piattaforma.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;SE &lt;/b&gt;lo studente non è registrato&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.2.1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di errore: “Accesso Negato:&amp;nbsp; Clicca qui Per Registarti”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.2.2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Lo studente clicca sul pulsante Registrati per chiudere il messaggio di errore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.2.3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Il Sistema invoca il caso d&#39; uso &quot;Registrazione Studente&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.3 ALTRIMENTI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.3.1 &lt;/b&gt;Il sistema richiede al DBMS i dati relativi all&#39; account&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.3.2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata “Home AFAM”&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="390" width="580" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="390" width="580" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
