        <mxCell id="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-15" parent="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flusso degli eventi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="370" width="380" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-16" parent="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante “Gestione Profilo”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 2 Il sistema mostra a video la schermata Gestione profilo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 3 &amp;nbsp;Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;DatiPersonali&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 4 &amp;nbsp; Il Sistema recupera dalla memoria i dati dello studente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata “Dati personali” contenente&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;i &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;dati &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;dello studente (Nome, Cognome, Foto, Email, Numero di telefono) e &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;il&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;pulsante &quot;Modifica Dati&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Modifica Dati&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video il form di modifica dei dati personali con i campi &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;editabili.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Lo studente&amp;nbsp;inserisce i nuovi dati .&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Lo studente&amp;nbsp;clicca sul pulsante &quot;Conferma Modifiche&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema invia i nuovi dati aggiornati al DBMS per la sovrascrittura &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;permanente sul database.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;      11&lt;/span&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Il sistema aggiorna i dati dello studente in memoria&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;     &lt;/span&gt;12&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di conferma: &quot;Modifiche effettuate &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;   &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;correttamente&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;     &lt;/span&gt;13&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;ok&quot; per chiudere il messaggio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 14&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra nuovamente la schermata &quot;Dati personali&quot; aggiornata &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;con i nuovi valori.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="410" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="370" width="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
