        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f9LOFpCgruJOSxP5PgEd-16" parent="f9LOFpCgruJOSxP5PgEd-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;Lo studente clicca su &quot;+&quot; accanto al file di interesse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema mostra a schermo un menu a tendina con varie voci&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente seleziona la voce &amp;nbsp;&quot;MODIFICA FILE&quot; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema mostra a schermo il form &amp;nbsp;contenente file,descrizione e titolo attuali del file &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;selezionato ed un pulsante conferma modifica&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente effettua le modifiche desiderate all&#39;interno del form&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;CONFERMA MODIFICA&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; 7 Il sistema recupera dalla memoria temporanea l&#39;identificativo dello studente&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema invia i nuovi dati inseriti al DBMS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema mostra a video il messaggio di conferma :Modifica effettuata correttamente.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;Lo studente clicca sul pulsante Ok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema mostra a schermo la schermata contenente i&amp;nbsp;file&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="440" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="240" width="440" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
