        <mxCell id="CBy3kFYD3NVFpVAmzLiz-15" parent="CBy3kFYD3NVFpVAmzLiz-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flusso degli eventi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="328" width="320" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="328" width="320" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CBy3kFYD3NVFpVAmzLiz-16" parent="CBy3kFYD3NVFpVAmzLiz-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;.Lo studente clicca sulla sezione &quot;Gestisci link&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Il sistema recupera dalla memoria temporanea l&#39;identificativo dello studente&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;.Il Sistema interroga il DBMS per recuperare la lista dei link generati dallo studente e il &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;  &lt;/span&gt;loro stato di visualizzazione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;3. SE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;lo studente non possiede alcun link generato:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;3.1&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video un messaggio di errore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;: &quot;Nessun link generato&quot;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;3.2&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;ok&quot;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;3.3&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata &quot;Gestione Condivisione Link&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;4. ALTRIMENTI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;(Ci sono link generati):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;4.1.&lt;/b&gt; Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata &quot;Elenco Link&quot;, contenente l&#39;elenco dei &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;link con un indicatore di avvenuta visualizzazione (es. spunta) e il pulsante &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;Revoca&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;209&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="328" width="490" x="320" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="328" width="490" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
