        <mxCell id="kfqNNyIC8x4uFTzeHV9c-16" parent="kfqNNyIC8x4uFTzeHV9c-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;.L&#39;utete clicca sul pulsante mostra contenuti pubblici&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;    &#x9;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema mostra a video la schermata&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contenuti pubblici&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 3Il sistema recupera dalla memoria l&#39;identificativo dello studente&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. L&#39;utente clicca sulla categoria artistica di cui vuole vedere i file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Il Sistema interroga il DBMS per recuperare le tipologie di file disponibili .&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata &quot;Categorie Contenuti&quot; elencando le &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;tipologie &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;trovate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. L&#39;utente clicca sulla tipologia di interesse.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Il Sistema interroga il DBMS per recuperare l&#39;elenco dei file caricati dallo studente &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;per quella specifica tipologia.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata &quot;Elenco File&quot; con i risultati trovati.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="460" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="280" width="460" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
