        <mxCell id="AgxdmlxoWYPFieNQjfDI-16" parent="AgxdmlxoWYPFieNQjfDI-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;Il Sistema riceve una richiesta di accesso tramite un link condiviso.(found message)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;2.Il Sistema&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;estrae il codice univoco dal link&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;Il Sistema&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;interroga il DBMS per verificarne lo stato.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;3.SE il link non è valido:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;3.1. Il Sistema mostra a video una schermata di errore: &quot;Spiacenti, questo link non è più attivo o è stato rimosso dallo studente&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;4ALTRIMENTI (Link valido):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;4.1. Il Sistema interroga il DBMS per recuperare l&#39;elenco dei contenuti (file) associati a quel link specifico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;4.2. Il Sistema aggiorna lo stato del link nel DBMS per segnalare l&#39;avvenuta visualizzazione .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;4.3. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,1,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&quot;Contenuti Condivisi&quot;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;, visualizzando l&#39;elenco dei file con i relativi titoli e descrizioni.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="440" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="350" width="440" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
